[D Quests for Dire Maul North \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 55-60 Dire Maul North]
[NX 55-60 Dire Maul West]

Dire Maul North is the Gordok ogre wing of the ruined elf city in the middle of Feralas. Walk in by the main gate on the south side, go north through the open courtyard, and the North door stands at its far end; the Dungeon Journal says it opens with the Crescent Key, which Pusillin drops in Dire Maul East (Wowhead item 18249). Quests here need level 54 to 60.

-- Left out: 7483, 7484, 7485 (Lydros's librams): each needs a Pristine Black Diamond, Large Brilliant Shards and a rare zone drop besides the libram (Wowhead quest tooltips); optional crafting turn-ins after Elven Legends.
-- Left out: 7429 Free Knot! and 5519 The Gordok Ogre Suit (repeat versions of 5525 and 5518, QuestieDB "needs one").
-- Left out: 1193 A Broken Trap: needs a Thorium Widget and Frost Oil made by an engineer and an alchemist (Wowhead tooltip); only helps the Tribute Run. 1318 Unfinished Gordok Business: Questie blacklists it as a duplicate of 7703.
-- Left out: 7481/7482 and 7498-7506 — in the Dire Maul West guide (DJ puts Lydros/Kildrath and Telmius' remains in the West wing).
-- Left out: 7461, 7877, 7462 (Shen'dralar Ancient, Capital Gardens) and 7507 to 7509 (Nostro's Compendium, rare drop, ends at Onyxia): West wing and raid chains. 8948 to 8950, 9015, 8967, 8970, 8990, 8996: dungeon-set upgrade chains. 5247 to 5253 and 7643 to 7666, 7631: Winterspring, Paladin and Warlock chains that only pass through the West wing.

-- Horde: Orgrimmar, Camp Taurajo, Camp Mojache.
