[A Horde] If you know the flight path, fly to Camp Taurajo [G44.5,59.1 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Otherwise walk there in the next steps.
[A Horde] Out through the Valley of Strength to the gate [G47.5,71.0 Orgrimmar][G52.0,82.0 Orgrimmar][G45.5,12.0 Durotar] [OC]
[A Horde] South-west across Durotar, west of the boulder ring, to the Southfury bridge [G38.5,21 Durotar][G36.5,30 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar] [OC] \\ An Infernal (elite, level 30) may roam near 39,29.
[A Horde] Over the bridge and west to the Crossroads [G61.8,20.0 The Barrens][G51.0,20.0 The Barrens][G52.0,30.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Razormane Berserkers and Flesheaters (elite, level 18-19) roam near the bridge.
[A Horde] South on the road to Camp Taurajo [G52.0,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G46.3,57.5 The Barrens][G44.5,59.1 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Azzere the Skyblade (elite, level 25) may fly near the road south of the Crossroads.
[A Horde] South on the road to the top of the Great Lift [G45.5,66.0 The Barrens][G44.7,78.2 The Barrens][G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Elite Razorfen Battleguards, Thornweavers and Death's Head Cultists (level 33-34) are close to the east of the lift. Also elite Ambassador Malcin (36), Hagg Taurenbane (26) and Razorfen Servitors (23-24).
[A Horde] Ride the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles [G32.1,24.2 Thousand Needles] [OC]
[A Horde] Follow the canyon west into Feralas [G30.7,24.4 Thousand Needles][G21.2,23.4 Thousand Needles][G18.5,22.3 Thousand Needles][G15.7,22.3 Thousand Needles][G13.0,21.5 Thousand Needles][G10.3,21.5 Thousand Needles] [OC] \\ An Enraged Panther and Rok'Alim the Pounder (elite, level 30) and a Ravaging Tempest (elite, level 40) may be on the way.
[A Horde] West past Thalanaar (Alliance; keep south of its guards) and on to Camp Mojache [G87.0,48.5 Feralas][G81,46 Feralas][G78.5,45.0 Feralas][G77.2,43.3 Feralas][G75.95,43.55 Feralas][G75.6,43.65 Feralas][G75.5,44.4 Feralas] [OC]
[A Horde] At Shyn, get the Camp Mojache flight path [P Camp Mojache] [G75.5,44.4 Feralas]
[A Horde] West out of camp on the road [G69.2,44.0 Feralas][G67.5,45.7 Feralas][G65.7,46.8 Feralas][G64.0,47.8 Feralas][G61.5,47.5 Feralas] [OC] \\ Grimtotem Raiders and Shamans (level 41-44) camp by the road near 67,46; a Vale Screamer (level 60) roams near 59,46.

-- Alliance: Ironforge, Menethil boat, Theramore, Thalanaar.
[A Alliance] Start in Ironforge [G55.9,47.9 Ironforge]
[A Alliance] If you know the flight path, fly to Menethil Harbor [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands] [OC] \\ Otherwise walk there in the next steps.
[A Alliance] Out of Ironforge and down to the Dun Morogh road, then east to the North Gate Pass [G53.6,33.9 Dun Morogh][G51.6,39.8 Dun Morogh][G56.9,47.1 Dun Morogh][G62.6,54.7 Dun Morogh][G67.0,52.5 Dun Morogh][G76.0,48.5 Dun Morogh][G81.5,41.0 Dun Morogh][G84.1,33.8 Dun Morogh] [OC] \\ QuestieDB places a Plague Zombie (level 50) near the road. Ghostfang and Hammerspine (elite, 10-12) are near the road.
[A Alliance] Through the pass and north to Dun Algaz [G20.7,17.5 Loch Modan][G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G25.5,11.5 Loch Modan] [OC]
[A Alliance] North into the Wetlands and west along the road to Menethil Harbor [G55.1,73.7 Wetlands][G57.0,49.5 Wetlands][G49.5,40.0 Wetlands][G35.0,40.5 Wetlands][G26.3,40.5 Wetlands][G23.4,42.5 Wetlands][G22.4,44.0 Wetlands][G14.0,47.0 Wetlands][G12.3,52.2 Wetlands] [OC] \\ Elite Dragonmaw orcs, Highland Lurkers and Elder Crocolisks (level 27-30) and Modr and Golm (elite, level 32) are near the road; all are far below your level. Also Goaz Warder, Nightveiled Rotheap and Highland Horror (elite, 28-32).
[A Alliance] Through the town to the south pier [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands][G4.7,63.8 Wetlands] [OC]
