[A Alliance] North out of Theramore along the shore road into the Barrens [G66.8,48.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G64.5,44.6 Dustwallow Marsh][G64.0,41.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G63.0,38.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.9,32.5 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.3,27.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G57.2,20.8 Dustwallow Marsh][G55.7,17.4 Dustwallow Marsh][G55.0,16.5 Dustwallow Marsh][G54.3,15.2 Dustwallow Marsh][G54.3,13.9 Dustwallow Marsh][G53.5,10.7 Dustwallow Marsh][G62.8,53.6 The Barrens] [OC] \\ QuestieDB lists Sully McCleary (level 50, hostile) near the road north of Theramore.
[A Alliance] West across the Barrens to the south road, then south to the top of the Great Lift [G52.0,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G47.5,58.0 The Barrens][G45.5,66.0 The Barrens][G44.7,78.2 The Barrens][G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] [OC] \\ Northwatch Hold (Alliance) is to the east; Camp Taurajo (Horde) is off the road to the west near 44,59, keep clear of its guards. Elite Razorfen quilboars (33-34) are near the lift. Also elite Ambassador Malcin (36), Hagg Taurenbane (26) and Razorfen Servitors (23-24).
[A Alliance] Ride the Great Lift down into Thousand Needles [G32.1,24.2 Thousand Needles] [OC]
[A Alliance] Follow the canyon west to Thalanaar [G30.7,24.4 Thousand Needles][G21.2,23.4 Thousand Needles][G18.5,22.3 Thousand Needles][G15.7,22.3 Thousand Needles][G13.0,21.5 Thousand Needles][G10.3,21.5 Thousand Needles][G89.5,45.9 Feralas] [OC] \\ An Enraged Panther and Rok'Alim the Pounder (elite, level 30) and a Ravaging Tempest (elite, level 40) may be on the way.
[A Alliance] At Thalanaar, get the flight path [P Thalanaar] [G89.5,45.9 Feralas]
[A Alliance] West along the south road past Camp Mojache to the Dire Maul main gate [G81,46 Feralas][G79.4,50.9 Feralas][G77,52 Feralas][G70,51 Feralas][G63,49 Feralas][G61.5,47.5 Feralas][G55.1,44.7 Feralas][G54.1,44.0 Feralas] [OC] \\ Camp Mojache (Horde) lies just north of 79,46; Gordok ogres (elite, 52-54) walk the road by the ruins.

-- Both: the main gate and the courtyard.
[A Horde] West along the road to the main gate [G59.0,45.0 Feralas][G55.6,45.0 Feralas][G54.1,44.0 Feralas] [OC] \\ Gordok ogres (elite) walk the road along the south wall.
Past the gate, north over the open ground west of the inner walls and in at the gap [G55.5,42.1 Feralas][G55.8,36.9 Feralas][G57.5,34.3 Feralas][G60.3,30.2 Feralas] [OC] \\ Gordok ogres (elite) camp in the courtyard; the West door is at 60.3,30.2.
North to the Dire Maul North door [G60.8,27.6 Feralas][G62.5,24.9 Feralas] [OC] \\ Needs the Crescent Key (Dungeon Journal). Gordok Maulers (elite, level 53-54) stand near the door.

-- Inside.
Knot Thimblejack, chained in the wing, gives [QA5525 Free Knot!] and [QA5518 The Gordok Ogre Suit]
Loot a Gordok Shackle Key from the ogres [QC5525] \\ Any ogre may drop it, the guards most often (Wowhead quest tooltip).
Optional: bring Knot 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 Rugged Leather, 2 Rune Threads and the Ogre Tannin from the basket past him, and turn in [QT5518 The Gordok Ogre Suit] *before* you free him \\ He leaves once freed (Dungeon Journal). [QC5518]
Free Knot [QT5525 Free Knot!]
[A Mage] Lorekeeper Lydros gives [QA7463 Arcane Refreshment] \\ Lydros stands in the Athenaeum. Level 60. Hydrospawn is in Dire Maul East; turn in on your next visit.
Kill King Gordok; Stomper Kreeg (hostile until then, per QuestieDB) gives [QA5528 The Gordok Taste Test] \\ Take it after the Tribute Run, then turn it in: [QT5528 The Gordok Taste Test]
Captain Kromcrush (hostile until King Gordok dies, per QuestieDB) gives [QA7703 Unfinished Gordok Business] \\ Bring him the Gauntlet of Gordok Might from Prince Tortheldrin in Dire Maul West (Dungeon Journal). [QC7703]
Captain Kromcrush takes [QT7703 Unfinished Gordok Business] \\ On a later Tribute Run, once you have the Gauntlet.
[A Mage] After killing Hydrospawn in Dire Maul East, Lydros takes [QT7463 Arcane Refreshment]
Leave by the North door [G62.5,24.9 Feralas] [OC]

